+    // state is touched, the legacy driver serializes per-port internally, and the
+    // caller's buffers are non-moving MP heap the calling thread keeps alive.
+    // Same pattern as this port's SPI/UART blocking waits.
+    MP_THREAD_GIL_EXIT();
